<view class="page data-v-b1f3d161"><view class="top data-v-b1f3d161"><text class="back data-v-b1f3d161" bindtap="{{a}}">‹</text><text class="title data-v-b1f3d161">欢迎加入奇德芬芳</text><text class="blank data-v-b1f3d161"></text></view><scroll-view scroll-y class="scroll data-v-b1f3d161"><view class="intro data-v-b1f3d161"><text class="moon data-v-b1f3d161">☾</text><text class="intro-title data-v-b1f3d161">让照护更懂您与宝宝</text><text class="intro-sub data-v-b1f3d161">只需几个选择，之后可以随时修改</text></view><view class="card data-v-b1f3d161"><view class="field data-v-b1f3d161"><text class="label data-v-b1f3d161">姓名或希望使用的称呼</text><input class="data-v-b1f3d161" type="nickname" maxlength="30" placeholder="如：王女士、晨晨妈妈（选填）" value="{{b}}" bindinput="{{c}}"/></view><view class="group data-v-b1f3d161"><text class="label data-v-b1f3d161">您是宝宝的？</text><view class="chips data-v-b1f3d161"><view wx:for="{{d}}" wx:for-item="x" wx:key="b" class="{{['data-v-b1f3d161', 'chip', x.c]}}" bindtap="{{x.d}}">{{x.a}}</view></view></view><view class="group data-v-b1f3d161"><text class="label data-v-b1f3d161">目前处于哪个阶段？</text><view class="stage-list data-v-b1f3d161"><view wx:for="{{e}}" wx:for-item="x" wx:key="b" class="{{['data-v-b1f3d161', 'stage', x.c]}}" bindtap="{{x.d}}"><text class="data-v-b1f3d161">{{x.a}}</text><text class="dot data-v-b1f3d161">✓</text></view></view></view><picker wx:if="{{f}}" class="data-v-b1f3d161" mode="date" value="{{h}}" bindchange="{{i}}"><view class="field row data-v-b1f3d161"><text class="label data-v-b1f3d161">预产期（选填）</text><text class="data-v-b1f3d161">{{g}} ›</text></view></picker><picker wx:if="{{j}}" class="data-v-b1f3d161" mode="date" value="{{l}}" bindchange="{{m}}"><view class="field row data-v-b1f3d161"><text class="label data-v-b1f3d161">宝宝出生日期（选填）</text><text class="data-v-b1f3d161">{{k}} ›</text></view></picker><view wx:if="{{n}}" class="group data-v-b1f3d161"><text class="label data-v-b1f3d161">当前喂养方式</text><view class="chips data-v-b1f3d161"><view wx:for="{{o}}" wx:for-i